<title>USA: CCF seeks to buy back 5 percent of shares.</title>
<headline>CCF seeks to buy back 5 percent of shares.</headline>
<dateline>JONESBORO, Ga. 1997-06-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>CCF Holding Co, parent corporation of Heritage Bank, said Thursday it has requested regulatory permission to repurchase up to 41,215 shares, or five percent of its outstanding common stock.</p>
<p>It is the third repurchase program undertaken by the bank in the past year.</p>
